---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Data Cloud for Marketing: Segmentación en Tiempo Real | Marketing Cloud Arcade">
<div class="article-hero">
  <div class="article-hero-inner">
    <div class="article-breadcrumb">
      <a href="/" data-lang="es">Inicio</a>
      <a href="/" data-lang="en">Home</a>
      <span class="sep">/</span>
      <a href="/catalog?cat=mc-next">MC Next</a>
      <span class="sep">/</span>
      <span data-lang="es">Data Cloud</span>
      <span data-lang="en">Data Cloud</span>
    </div>

    <div style="display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:1rem;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:1rem;">
      <span class="tag" style="background:rgba(189,147,249,0.2);border:1px solid #bd93f9;color:#bd93f9;">🔮 MC NEXT</span>
      <span class="tag">#datacloud</span>
      <span class="tag">#segmentation</span>
      <span class="level-badge intermediate">🟡 Intermediate</span>
    </div>

    <h1 data-lang="es">Data Cloud for Marketing: Segmentación en Tiempo Real y Activación</h1>
    <h1 data-lang="en">Data Cloud for Marketing: Real-Time Segmentation & Activation</h1>

    <div class="article-meta">
      <span class="article-meta-item">📅 <span data-lang="es">Actualizado</span><span data-lang="en">Updated</span>: May 2025</span>
      <span class="article-meta-item">⏱️ 10 min read</span>
      <span class="article-meta-item">👁️ <span data-random-views data-article-id="next-datacloud-segments">0</span> views</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="article-layout">
  <article class="article-content" is:raw>

    <!-- SPANISH CONTENT -->
    <div data-lang="es">
      <p><strong>Marketing Cloud Next</strong> cambia radicalmente el paradigma de datos: en lugar de duplicar tablas en Data Extensions tradicionales, se apoya en <strong>Data Cloud</strong> como motor unificado de identidad, streaming data y segmentación multidimensional en tiempo real.</p>

      <div class="callout">
        <div class="callout-label">📌 CONCEPTO CLAVE · MC NEXT</div>
        Data Cloud unifica perfiles (Unified Individual) con Identity Resolution rules. Las audiencias creadas aquí se activan de forma instantánea hacia Journey Builder, Marketing Cloud Growth o canales publicitarios sin necesidad de Query Activities complejas en Automation Studio.
      </div>

      <h2 id="arquitectura">01 · ARQUITECTURA DE DATOS: DMO vs DATA EXTENSION</h2>
      <p>En MC Next trabajamos con <strong>Data Model Objects (DMOs)</strong> estándar como <code>UnifiedIndividual__dlm</code>, <code>SalesOrder__dlm</code> o <code>WebEngagement__dlm</code>.</p>

      <div class="code-block">
        <div class="code-block-header">
          <div class="code-block-dots"><div class="code-block-dot"></div><div class="code-block-dot"></div><div class="code-block-dot"></div></div>
          <span class="code-block-lang">Data Cloud · Calculated Insight SQL</span>
          <button class="code-copy-btn">📋 Copiar</button>
        </div>
        <pre><span class="cm">/* Calculated Insight: CLV y RFM en Data Cloud */</span>
<span class="kw">SELECT</span>
  <span class="vr">ssot__Individual__dlm.ssot__Id__c</span> <span class="kw">AS</span> <span class="vr">CustomerId__c</span>,
  <span class="fn">SUM</span>(<span class="vr">ssot__SalesOrder__dlm.ssot__GrandTotalAmount__c</span>) <span class="kw">AS</span> <span class="vr">LifetimeSpend__c</span>,
  <span class="fn">MAX</span>(<span class="vr">ssot__SalesOrder__dlm.ssot__PurchaseOrderDate__c</span>) <span class="kw">AS</span> <span class="vr">LastPurchaseDate__c</span>,
  <span class="fn">COUNT</span>(<span class="vr">ssot__SalesOrder__dlm.ssot__Id__c</span>) <span class="kw">AS</span> <span class="vr">OrderCount__c</span>
<span class="kw">FROM</span> <span class="vr">ssot__Individual__dlm</span>
<span class="kw">JOIN</span> <span class="vr">ssot__SalesOrder__dlm</span> 
  <span class="kw">ON</span> <span class="vr">ssot__Individual__dlm.ssot__Id__c</span> = <span class="vr">ssot__SalesOrder__dlm.ssot__SoldToCustomerId__c</span>
<span class="kw">GROUP BY</span> <span class="vr">ssot__Individual__dlm.ssot__Id__c</span></pre>
      </div>

      <h2 id="activacion">02 · ACTIVACIÓN DIRECTA A ENGAGEMENT & GROWTH</h2>
      <p>Al crear un <strong>Segment Target</strong> en Data Cloud, puedes activar atributos directos y métricas calculadas (Calculated Insights) hacia <strong>Marketing Cloud Engagement</strong> como Data Extensions sincronizadas o disparar flujos basados en eventos de streaming (Data Cloud Triggered Flows).</p>

      <div class="callout">
        <div class="callout-label">⚡ PRO TIP</div>
        Utiliza <strong>Data Graphs</strong> en Data Cloud para empaquetar perfiles con todos sus datos relacionados (pedidos, carritos, preferencias) en un único objeto optimizado para personalización ultrarrápida.
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- ENGLISH CONTENT -->
    <div data-lang="en">
      <p><strong>Marketing Cloud Next</strong> fundamentally evolves the data architecture: rather than syncing and duplicating tables into traditional Data Extensions, it leverages <strong>Data Cloud</strong> as the real-time unified identity and multidimensional segmentation engine.</p>

      <div class="callout">
        <div class="callout-label">📌 KEY CONCEPT · MC NEXT</div>
        Data Cloud creates a Unified Individual through Identity Resolution. Audiences created here activate instantly to Journey Builder, Marketing Cloud Growth, or Ad networks without complex SQL Query Activities in Automation Studio.
      </div>

      <h2 id="architecture-en">01 · DATA ARCHITECTURE: DMO vs DATA EXTENSION</h2>
      <p>In MC Next we work with standard <strong>Data Model Objects (DMOs)</strong> such as <code>UnifiedIndividual__dlm</code>, <code>SalesOrder__dlm</code>, and <code>WebEngagement__dlm</code>.</p>

      <div class="code-block">
        <div class="code-block-header">
          <div class="code-block-dots"><div class="code-block-dot"></div><div class="code-block-dot"></div><div class="code-block-dot"></div></div>
          <span class="code-block-lang">Data Cloud · Calculated Insight SQL</span>
          <button class="code-copy-btn">📋 Copy</button>
        </div>
        <pre><span class="cm">/* Calculated Insight: CLV & RFM in Data Cloud */</span>
<span class="kw">SELECT</span>
  <span class="vr">ssot__Individual__dlm.ssot__Id__c</span> <span class="kw">AS</span> <span class="vr">CustomerId__c</span>,
  <span class="fn">SUM</span>(<span class="vr">ssot__SalesOrder__dlm.ssot__GrandTotalAmount__c</span>) <span class="kw">AS</span> <span class="vr">LifetimeSpend__c</span>,
  <span class="fn">MAX</span>(<span class="vr">ssot__SalesOrder__dlm.ssot__PurchaseOrderDate__c</span>) <span class="kw">AS</span> <span class="vr">LastPurchaseDate__c</span>,
  <span class="fn">COUNT</span>(<span class="vr">ssot__SalesOrder__dlm.ssot__Id__c</span>) <span class="kw">AS</span> <span class="vr">OrderCount__c</span>
<span class="kw">FROM</span> <span class="vr">ssot__Individual__dlm</span>
<span class="kw">JOIN</span> <span class="vr">ssot__SalesOrder__dlm</span> 
  <span class="kw">ON</span> <span class="vr">ssot__Individual__dlm.ssot__Id__c</span> = <span class="vr">ssot__SalesOrder__dlm.ssot__SoldToCustomerId__c</span>
<span class="kw">GROUP BY</span> <span class="vr">ssot__Individual__dlm.ssot__Id__c</span></pre>
      </div>

      <h2 id="activation-en">02 · DIRECT ACTIVATION TO ENGAGEMENT & GROWTH</h2>
      <p>When creating a <strong>Segment Target</strong> in Data Cloud, you can activate direct attributes and Calculated Insights metrics directly into <strong>Marketing Cloud Engagement</strong> as auto-refreshed Data Extensions or fire Data Cloud Triggered Flows.</p>

      <div class="callout">
        <div class="callout-label">⚡ PRO TIP</div>
        Use <strong>Data Graphs</strong> in Data Cloud to bundle customer profiles with all related objects (orders, carts, preferences) into a single payload optimized for sub-second personalization.
      </div>
    </div>

  </article>

